# Claims and store tokens are LIVE coordination state, not durable record.
#
# All seats run scripts/queue/cli.mjs against this one checkout, so coordination
# is filesystem-local and instant; git is not in that path. Committing a claim
# would let a stale one resurrect on a pull and block a seat that holds nothing.
# They expire on their own; a resurrected one would expire too, but only after
# blocking real work for its full TTL.
#
# The LOGS are the durable record and ARE committed: every claim, refusal and
# release, namespaced per seat.
cards/*/claim.json
tokens/
